# Testing

> Purpose: every plan unit has tests matching its *Done when* — no coverage theater.

## Rules
1. Test new business logic and every auth/pricing/payment-critical path.
2. Fast unit tests for pure functions; integration tests for API + DB.
3. Per endpoint: happy · validation fail (422) · unauthenticated (401) · forbidden (403) · not found (404).
4. Name tests by behavior, not implementation.
5. Never merge knowingly broken tests; if no runner exists yet, say so instead of faking coverage.
